---
title: Pear and Almond Cream Tart
description: An indulgent dessert
source: Best-Ever Pastry Cookbook <urn:isbn:1843094703>
author: Catherine Atkinson
servings: 6
course: Dessert
locale: en_GB
difficulty: Medium
prep time: 45m
cook time: 55m
cuisine: French
diet: Vegetarian
tags:
